      "writtenOn": "2026-09-30T23:46:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Doesn\u0027t `close_fd()` `fput()` the dmabuf file, so wouldn\u0027t this lead to a use after free since you follow it up with `dma_buf_put()`?",
      "revId": "81f7937c7d362e68bccfa790920b263d43460baa",
