      "writtenOn": "2026-10-19T10:48:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No. test_data.wrapfd was holding the last reference to dmabuf after we ran `close_fd(dmabuf_fd)`, so closing it will free the dmabuf.",
      "parentUuid": "41215264_374fa3ef",
      "revId": "81f7937c7d362e68bccfa790920b263d43460baa",
