      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-09-30T23:46:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You can also ditch the `IS_ENABLED()` guard and write this as:\n\n\n```\nVISIBLE_IF_KUNIT int create_wrapfd(...)\n{\n        ...\n}\nEXPORT_SYMBOL_IF_KUNIT(create_wrapfd);\n```\n\nSo that it is only visible to external compilation units when Kunit is enabled, and so that you export the symbol only into the Kunit namespace.\n\nDitto with `empty_wrapfd()`.",
      "revId": "81f7937c7d362e68bccfa790920b263d43460baa",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "20e9763c_b9e8c92d",
        "filename": "drivers/android/wrapfd.c",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 1791,
      "author": {
        "id": 1157738
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-10-19T10:48:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I considered that but VISIBLE_IF_KUNIT only changes the visibility of the function (static vs non-static). In this case I want the function itself to be compiled out.",
      "parentUuid": "dba54130_0f2ce548",
      "revId": "81f7937c7d362e68bccfa790920b263d43460baa",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
